<%doc>
QTL search help.
</%doc>

<%perl>

my $qtl_search_page = qq | <a href="/search/qtl">QTL/性狀搜尋(QTL/Trait search)</a> |;
my $search_form     = qq | <img src="/documents/help/screenshots/qtl_cvterm_searchform.png" /> |;
my $search_result   = qq | <img src="/documents/help/screenshots/qtl_cvterm_results.png"/>|;
my $pop_list        = qq | <img src="/documents/help/screenshots/qtl_cvterm_poplist.png"/> |;
my $qtl_genome      = qq | <img src="/documents/help/screenshots/qtl_genome.png" /> |;
my $qtl_detail      = qq | <img src="/documents/help/screenshots/qtl_detail2.png" /> |;
my $chr_location    = qq | <img src="/documents/help/screenshots/qtl_cvterm_qtl_chrloc.png" /> |;
my $cview_help      = qq | <a href="/help/cview"> |;
my $contact         = qq | <a href="mailto:sgn-feedback\@solgenomics.net">sgn-feedback\@solgenomics.net</a> |; 

</%perl>

<& /page/page_title.mas, 
   title=>'QTL 搜尋頁面(QTL Search Page)'
&>

<br><% $qtl_search_page %> 會返回可能包含 QTL 資料的表型性狀。QTL 分析是即時進行的(The <% $qtl_search_page %> returns phenotypic traits that may have qtl data. QTL analysis is performed on the fly)。<br /> 


<br><b>1. 使用性狀名稱搜尋資料庫。例如：「果實形狀」(Search the database using a trait name. For example, 'fruit shape')。</b><br/>

<% $search_form %>

<br/><b>2. 點擊您感興趣性狀的連結(Follow the link for the trait of your interest)。</b><br/>

<% $search_result %>

<br><b>3. 選擇您感興趣的性狀後（例如性狀「果實圓形」），您將被帶到性狀 (cvterm) 頁面，向下滾動到「表型資料/QTL」子區段。選擇評估該性狀的感興趣群體。例如群體「Howard German x LA1589」(After selecting the trait of your interest, for example the trait 'fruit shape circular', you will be taken to the trait (cvterm) page, scroll down to the 'Phenotype data/QTL' subsection. Select the population of interest for which the trait was evaluated. For example, the population 'Howard German x LA1589')。</b><br/>

<% $pop_list %>


<br><b>4. 目視確定哪個連鎖群包含 QTL，查看圖例中的 LOD 閾值。例如，第 7 號染色體有一個 QTL。點擊感興趣的連鎖群，並在新視窗中點擊連結「前往 QTL 頁面...」(Visually determine which linkage group contains a QTL, see the LOD threshold in the legend. For example, chromosome 7 has a QTL. Click the linkage group of interest and on the new window, follow the link "Go to the QTL page...")。</b><br/>

<% $qtl_genome %>

<br><b>6. 點擊「前往 QTL 頁面」會產生 QTL 詳細資訊頁面，其中顯示了 QTL 信賴區間、標記基因組位置的連結、標記詳細資訊頁面以及 SGN 的比較地圖檢視器等(Clicking the "Go to the QTL page" generates the QTL detail page where among others the QTL confidence interval, links to the genome positions of the markers, marker detail pages, and SGN's Comparative Map Viewer are displayed)。</b><br/>

<% $qtl_detail %>

<br><b>7. QTL 詳細資訊頁面（如上所示）提供了從 QTL 到其他相關遺傳與基因組資料以及生物資訊工具的交叉引用。例如，要查看感興趣性狀 QTL 的遺傳位置，並使用比較地圖檢視器將其與其他遺傳圖譜進行比較，請點擊「QTL 標記的遺傳位置與比較地圖檢視器」子區段下的連鎖群連結(The QTL detail page (shown above) presents cross-references from the QTL to other relevant genetic and genomic data and bioinformatic tools. Forexample, to view the genetic location of the QTL of a trait of interest and compare it to other genetic maps using the Comparative Map Viewer, click the linkage group link under the 'QTL markers' genetic positions and Comparative Map Viewer' subection)。</b><br/>

<br>QTL 遺傳位置(QTL genetic location)：<br/>

<% $chr_location %>

<br><b>若要了解如何對相同或不同茄科物種的遺傳圖譜和物理圖譜執行比較分析，請閱讀此 <% $cview_help %> 說明文件(help document)。</a>(To learn on how to perform comparative analysis with genetic maps and physical maps of the same or different Solanaceae species, please read this <% $cview_help %> help document.)</b><br />  


<br><b>如果您有任何疑問，請透過以下方式聯繫我們(If you have questions, please contact us at)：<% $contact %> </b><br/>
